  "source": "RUN  AT_BoarAirSensor.Calibrate_Sensor()\nTHEN AT_BoarAirSensor.Read_Temp(C)\nIF   AT_BoarAirSensor.Read_Temp(C) > 25 AND AT_BoarAirSensor.Read_Humidity() > 45\nDO\n     AT_BoarAirSensor.Fan_On(60)\n     AT_BoarAirSensor.Set_Window(40)\nELSE\n     AT_BoarAirSensor.Fan_Off()\n     AT_BoarAirSensor.Window_Close()\nEND",
